  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1640.01 Storage of Low Explosives. Table 1640.1, cited below, shall set forth the distances for storage of low explosives:\n\nTable 1640.1 Distances for Storage of Low Explosives\n\nPounds Over | Pounds Not Over | Inhabited Buildings Distance (Feet) | Public Rail Road & Highway Distance (Feet) | Above ground Magazine Separation Distance (Feet)\n\n0 | 1,000 | 75 | 75 | 50\n\n1,000 | 5,000 | 115 | 115 | 75\n\n5,000 | 10,000 | 150 | 150 | 100\n\n10,000 | 20,000 | 190 | 190 | 125\n\n20,000 | 30,000 | 215 | 215 | 145\n\n30,000 | 40,000 | 235 | 235 | 155\n\n40,000 | 50,000 | 250 | 250 | 165\n\n50,000 | 60,000 | 260 | 260 | 175\n\n60,000 | 70,000 | 270 | 270 | 185\n\n70,000 | 80,000 | 280 | 280 | 190\n\n80,000 | 90,000 | 295 | 295 | 195\n\n90,000 | 100,000 | 300 | 300 | 200\n\n100,000 | 200,000 | 375 | 375 | 250\n\n200,000 | 300,000 | 450 | 450 | 300\n\nSource. #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss and moved by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03 (formerly Saf-C 1666.01)\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
